== simulation: an independent size estimate used one way only. Shrink to the estimated area when the 0.5 mask exceeds k times the estimate.
   estimate = true area x log-normal error, sd 0.7 / 1.0 / 1.4; gain over fixed 0.5, mean of 20 draws
